    "OT_VERSE_LINE": "Isaiah 40:28 — “The LORD is the everlasting God, the Creator of the ends of the earth.”",
    "NT_VERSE_LINE": "1 Peter 4:19 — “Entrust their souls to a faithful Creator in doing what is right.”",
    "GREEK": "Κτίστης",
    "GREEK_TRANSLIT": "Ktistēs",
    "HEBREW": "בּוֹרֵא",
    "HEBREW_TRANSLIT": "Bore",
